                "description": "The Knoxville Beaded Single Cylinder Deadbolt will fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick to 3 inches thick with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The beaded edges adds a beautiful element to this arched deadbolt, elevating it from plain and traditional to classic and glamorous. The Knoxville Single Cylinder Deadbolt with Beaded Edge is a  single cylinder deadbolt, so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior.",
